pen your MySQL management tool or database UI, such as ",[210,211,212],"code",{},"mysql",", ",[215,216,220],"a",{"href":217,"rel":218},"https:\u002F\u002Fdbeaver.io\u002F",[219],"nofollow","DBeaver",", or ",[215,223,226],{"href":224,"rel":225},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.phpmyadmin.net\u002F",[219],"PHPMyAdmin",", and connect to the database used by FiveNet or your gameserver.",[206,229,230,231,234,235,316,326,329,332],{},"Navigate to the ",[210,232,233],{},"fivenet_accounts"," table and create a new entry with the following values:",[236,237,238,251],"table",{},[239,240,241],"thead",{},[242,243,244,248],"tr",{},[245,246,247],"th",{},"Field",[245,249,250],{},"Value Description",[252,253,254,269,292,302],"tbody",{},[242,255,256,262],{},[257,258,259],"td",{},[210,260,261],{},"enabled",[257,263,264,265,268],{},"Set to ",[210,266,267],{},"1"," to enable the account.",[242,270,271,276],{},[257,272,273],{},[210,274,275],{},"license",[257,277,278,279,213,282,213,285,213,288,291],{},"Your in-game identifier\u002Flicense without any prefix (e.g., ",[210,280,281],{},"char*:",[210,283,284],{},"license:",[210,286,287],{},"steam:",[210,289,290],{},"discord:",").",[242,293,294,299],{},[257,295,296],{},[210,297,298],{},"reg_token",[257,300,301],{},"A 6-digit registration token for account registration.",[242,303,304,309],{},[257,305,306],{},[210,307,308],{},"groups",[257,310,311,312,315],{},"A JSON string array, e.g., ",[210,313,314],{},"[\"admin\"]"," (list of groups).",[317,318,319],"blockquote",{},[191,320,321,325],{},[322,323,324],"strong",{},"Note:"," Leave all other fields as they are.",[327,328],"br",{},[322,330,331],{},"Example query:",[333,334,339],"pre",{"className":335,"code":336,"language":337,"meta":338,"style":338},"language-sql shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","INSERT INTO `fivenet_accounts` (`enabled`, `license`, `reg_token`, `groups`) VALUES (1, 'YOUR_LICENSE_HERE', '123456', '[\"admin\"]');\n","sql","",[210,340,341],{"__ignoreMap":338},[342,343,346,350,354,357,360,364,366,368,370,372,374,376,378,380,382,384,386,388,390,392,394,397,400,402,404,406,409,412,414,416,418,421,423,425,427,429,431],"span",{"class":344,"line":345},"line",1,[342,347,349],{"class":348},"sbssI","INSERT INTO",[342,351,353],{"class":352},"sMK4o"," `",[342,355,233],{"class":356},"sfazB",[342,358,359],{"class":352},"`",[342,361,363],{"class":362},"sTEyZ"," (",[342,365,359],{"class":352},[342,367,261],{"class":356},[342,369,359],{"class":352},[342,371,213],{"class":362},[342,373,359],{"class":352},[342,375,275],{"class":356},[342,377,359],{"class":352},[342,379,213],{"class":362},[342,381,359],{"class":352},[342,383,298],{"class":356},[342,385,359],{"class":352},[342,387,213],{"class":362},[342,389,359],{"class":352},[342,391,308],{"class":356},[342,393,359],{"class":352},[342,395,396],{"class":362},") ",[342,398,399],{"class":348},"VALUES",[342,401,363],{"class":362},[342,403,267],{"class":348},[342,405,213],{"class":362},[342,407,408],{"class":352},"'",[342,410,411],{"class":356},"YOUR_LICENSE_HERE",[342,413,408],{"class":352},[342,415,213],{"class":362},[342,417,408],{"class":352},[342,419,420],{"class":356},"123456",[342,422,408],{"class":352},[342,424,213],{"class":362},[342,426,408],{"class":352},[342,428,314],{"class":356},[342,430,408],{"class":352},[342,432,433],{"class":362},");\n",[206,435,436],{},"Open your FiveNet instance in your browser, navigate to the registration page, and use the registration token to create your account.",[206,438,439,440,442,443,446,447,449,450,453],{},"Once registered, log in to FiveNet. If the ",[210,441,275],{}," value is correct, you should see any characters (",[210,444,445],{},"users"," table) associated with the ",[210,448,275],{},"\u002F",[210,451,452],{},"identifier",".",[195,455,457],{"id":456},"_2-install-the-fivenet-plugin-on-your-gameserver","2. Install the FiveNet Plugin on Your Gameserver",[191,459,460],{},"To connect FiveNet to your gameserver:",[462,463,464,473],"ul",{},[206,465,466,467,472],{},"Download the ",[215,468,471],{"href":469,"rel":470},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffivenet-app\u002Fplugins\u002Ftree\u002Fmain\u002Ffivem\u002Ffivenet",[219],"FiveM Plugin code"," from GitHub.",[206,474,475],{},"Install and configure the plugin on your FiveM server.",[477,478,479,484],"callout",{},[191,480,481],{},[322,482,483],{},"Important:",[462,485,486,493],{},[206,487,488,489,492],{},"Read the ",[210,490,491],{},"README.md"," file of the plugin you install and follow the instructions to ensure optimal setup.",[206,494,495],{},"Add event triggers to your ESX plugins as required. Not all events collected by FiveNet are available in the standard ESX plugin code.",[191,497,498,499,453],{},"For additional details and step-by-step setup guidance, refer to the ",[215,500,502],{"href":501},"..\u002Fgameserver\u002Ffivem-plugin\u002Finstallation","plugin installation documentation",[195,504,506],{"id":505},"_3-configure-your-fivenet","3. Configure Your FiveNet",[191,508,509,510,513,514,517,518,521],{},"When logged in with a character selected, you must be able to enable superuser mode (controlled by config option ",[210,511,512],{},"auth.configAdminGroups"," and ",[210,515,516],{},"auth.configAdminUsers","), navigate to your \"FiveNet Settings\" (",[210,519,520],{},"\u002Fsettings\u002Fsettings"," URL path).",[191,523,524],{},"In there go over each tab and configure them to suit your servers' config, jobs and roleplay.",[191,526,527],{},"Some of the most important settings to configure here are:",[203,529,530,538],{},[206,531,532,533],{},"\"Jobs & Tracker\" Tab\n",[462,534,535],{},[206,536,537],{},"Make sure to select the correct enemployed job and grade.",[206,539,540,541],{},"\"Website\" Tab\n",[462,542,543],{},[206,544,545],{},"Make sure to set the URLs to your gameservers' privacy policy and imprint pages.",[547,548,549],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F7